          "bodyExcerpt": "N5+ by Sinvertek | RockBoard | PedalPedia Skip to main content LOG IN EXPLORE Sinvertek N5+ LOG IN TO SUGGEST IMPROVEMENTS DISTORTION PREAMP Description Designed as a feature-rich, high-gain preamplifier and distortion unit, this pedal replicates the complex gain structures and response of high-end tube amplifiers. It incorporates extensive tone-shaping controls, including a multi-band EQ alongside parametric toggle switches to adjust gain saturation, low-end response, and mid-range voicings. Operating through all-analog circuitry, it offers multiple boost modes to alter volume and gain staging via the footswitch. The unit is built to maintain clarity and dynamic pick attack even under extreme saturation levels. Designed to integrate cleanly into any rig, it can function either as an front-of-amp drive unit or as a standalone preamp feeding a power amplifier. Media Videos Demo by Pete Thorn (EN) Technical data Width 000.00 mm Depth 000.00 mm Height 000.00 mm Weight 000.00 mm Circuit type analog More pedals from Sinvertek PREAMP PREAMP Sinvertek N5 MGAT-1 Golden Era PREAMP PREAMP Sinvertek MGAT-1 EVO (Abstractionism Edition) PREAMP PREAMP Sinvertek SRAA MGAT -1 EVO (Great Era Edition) DISTORTION OVERDRIVE DISTORTION OVERDRIVE Sinvertek SHODA All Sinvertek Pedals Products Pedalboards All-In-One Patchbays QuickMount PedalSafe Power Supplies and Power Cables and Connections Accessories Gear Build your own board Board Configurator PedalPedia Pedalboard Gallery QuickMount Finder Services Find a dealer Find a distributor Frequently Asked Questions Contact Current catalog News Community RockBoard Artists Achievements Your Activity Overview ©2026 Warwick GmbH Co. Music Equipment KG GTC | Imprint | Privacy policy | Accessibility | Cookie Settings",
