          "snippet": "Pandora Octave Fuzz - Sitek Guitar Electronics",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Pandora Octave Fuzz | Sitek Guitar Electronics Home Pedals Booster / Pre-amp Overdrive Distortion / Fuzz Delay / Modulation Utility Discontinued Accessories Cables Picks Clothing Mugs About Contact Artists FAQs PL 0 0 Basket Home / Pedals / Distortion / Fuzz / Pandora Octave Fuzz Pandora Octave Fuzz $ 175.00 Lowest price 30 days before the discount: $ 175.00 Pandora is a versatile high gain fuzz pedal allowing you to dial in a variety of original tones ranging from warm fuzz to top-end rich sound and anything in between. By increasing the gain you can saturate the distortion and increase sustain. Open Pandora’s box of fuzz even more for a natural upper octave to become more prominent. 1 in stock (can be backordered) Pandora Octave Fuzz quantity Add to basket Share this product Categories: Distortion / Fuzz , Pedals Tags: fuzz , fuzz pedal , guitar gear , guitar pedal , stompbox Previous Product Next Product Description Additional information Controls Videos Warranty Description Meet Pandora, a beautiful creation that came from the fires of Olymp. Designed as an instrument of the wrath of Zeus, she fills your guitar tone with all the wickedness that was once hidden in her insidious box.. Pandora is a versatile high gain fuzz pedal allowing you to dial in a variety of original tones ranging from warm fuzz to top-end rich sound and anything in between. By increasing the gain you can saturate the distortion and increase sustain. Open Pandora’s box of fuzz even more for a natural upper octave to become more prominent and fine-tune this chaos force with five simple controls. She will definitely make your riffs gnarly and powerful. This Muse is a 100% discrete analog circuit designed on five carefully designed gain stages, with high quality components reducing circuit noise. Pandora is suitable for both live and studio applications. Additional information Weight 0.31 kg Dimensions 11 &times; 6 &times; 4 cm Controls Smooth-Click™ Footswitch : The pedal is equipped with the DeMont Smooth-Click footswitch &#8211; the highest quality footswitch on the market &#8211; and provides True Bypass operation. Level : Controls the output volume of the pedal. Fuzz : Controls the amount of distortion and saturation. Tone : Modifies the frequency content of the signal. Turn clockwise for more high end. Color : Controls the character of the sound. Turn clockwise for more open/dynamic tone Turn counter-clockwise for more compressed/saturated sound Clipping Switch : Selects one of the clipping modes: II &#8211; asymmetrical clipping using a pair of germanium and silicon diodes which produce more open and dynamic tone I &#8211; symmetrical clipping using two NOS germanium diodes which provide more tight and compressed fuzz characteristic Videos Warranty This pedal comes with a 5 year warranty on workmanship and components. If your device suddenly stops working please send us an email at hello@sitek.rocks and we will work it out. Within 5 year the repair will be done free of charge excluding shipping fee. This warranty does not include misuse or accidents resulting in damage. For more information, please check Terms Conditions You may also like&hellip; Fuzzie Germanium Fuzz v2 $ 185.00 Add to basket Cocoa Distortion $ 160.00 Add to basket Sitek Sound Muses Mug $ 15.00 Add to basket Related products Pearl Guitar Pick (0.71 mm) $ 5.00 Add to basket Phasia Phase Shifter $ 255.00 Add to basket Freya Overdrive/Booster $ 230.00 Add to basket Vixen Germanium Booster $ 180.00 Add to basket Contact Terms &#038; Conditions Terms of Use of the Website Privacy Policy Copyright © 2026 Sitek Guitar Electronics | Kosakowo, Poland × Home Pedals Booster / Pre-amp Overdrive Distortion / Fuzz Delay / Modulation Utility Discontinued Accessories Cables Picks Clothing Mugs About Contact Artists FAQs PL &times; What are you looking for? Do you want to hide this popup? We are using cookies to give you the best experience on our website. You can find ou