d results are easy, and the voice is strong. Power Regular 9v negative ground, no special power requirements. 9v battery is not included. If you use a battery, then remember to un-plug the input cable from the pedal’s input jack when not in use to prevent draining (or you can also just plug in a power-supply, which disconnects the battery). You may supply external power through an AC adapter. All Skreddy Pedals accept the industry-standard 9v DC plug (5.5mm barrel x 2.1mm center coax), negative tip. Please use a quality, regulated, filtered power supply. Reviews Sound Clips Marc Ahlfs Quick demo with Strat... Marc Ahlfs Quick demo with Ibanez and Echo... Ilya Lipkin (Facebook Video:) Jamming with the Cephalopod II Similar Pedals Dynamic Mids Enhancer Skreddy Pedals Clean guitar preamp with three midrange contour gain controls $205 $184.50 P19 Skreddy Pedals Smooth soaring sustain $259 $233.10 Martian Tarantula Skreddy Pedals Well-behaved Tonebender Mk1 fuzz $259 $233.10 Serenity Fuzzdrive Skreddy Pedals Smooth, sweet, amp-like fuzzy drive $259 $233.10 Skunk Drive Skreddy Pedals Vintage cutting fuzz/overdrive like early Zeppelin $237 $213.30 Rubber Soul Skreddy Pedals Jangly, glassy, cleanish British combo sound $290 $261 Klipper Skreddy Pedals Huge, amp-like, Sabbathy fuzz $259 $233.10 Cookie Preferences We rely on cookies for storing your shopping cart and regional settings between visits. Functionality Cookies &mdash; Shopping cart, language, and regional preferences Personalization Cookies &mdash; Remember your preferences across visits Analytics Cookies &mdash; Help us understand how visitors use our site Advertising Cookies &mdash; Used to serve and measure relevant ads Ad User Data &mdash; Sends user data to Google for advertising purposes Personalized Ads &mdash; Shows ads tailored to your interests Security Cookies &mdash; Always active, required for site security Apply Cancel Effect Types Boost Overdrive Fuzz Delay Modulation Octave Utilities all Account Cr