          "bodyExcerpt": "Skreddy Pedals Ernie | Effects Database Skip to navigation Brands &#9660; 0-9... a... b... c... d... e... f... g... h... i... j... k... l... m... n... o... p... q... r... s... t... u... v... w... x... y... z... Effect types &#9660; boost distortion fuzz overdrive acoustic simulation amp simulation speaker/cabinet simulation chorus flanger phaser tremolo vibe vibrato other modulation pitch shifter octaver delay reverb looper/sampler hold/freeze eq filter wah fuzz-wah bitcrusher ring modulator samplerate reducer wavefolder synth effect granular effect multi effect vocal effect talkbox vocoder buffer compressor other... Countries &#9660; (country unknown) Argentina Australia Austria Belarus Belgium Brazil Bulgaria Canada Chile China Colombia Costa Rica Croatia Czech Republic Czechoslovakia DDR Denmark Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt Estonia Finland France Germany Greece Hungary India Indonesia Iran Ireland Israel Italy Japan Latvia Lithuania Luxembourg Macedonia Malaysia Malta Mexico Moldova Monaco Morocco Netherlands New-Zealand Norway Panama Peru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Russia Serbia Singapore Slovakia Slovenia South-Africa South-Korea Spain Sweden Switzerland Taiwan Thailand Turkey U.K. U.S.A. U.S.S.R. Ukraine Uruguay Venezuela Browse by &#9660; Enclosure type Modulation type Special &#9658; Classics Eye candy Funny Vaporware Weird Random brand Random effect Events &#9658; NAMM Musikmesse Music China Guitar Summit More... &#9660; Forum (opens in new tab) myFXDB (opens in new tab) Newsletter About How to get listed? Interviews Reviews Effects explained Books D.I.Y. Schematics Links Contact Install Effects Database App Search the database browse by brand S... Skreddy Pedals browse by type distortion/fuzz/overdrive fuzz browse by enclosure pedal Skreddy Pedals Ernie Published on March 24, 2006 Skreddy Pedals fuzz pedal ernie #1 ernie #1 ernie #1 ernie #1 Information Skreddy Pedals Thick and fuzzy but articulate, with an old school feel Modeled sonically on the beloved 'lamb's head' edition of vintage fuzz boxes, the Ernie is a 4-silicon-transistor distortion/fuzz/sustain stompbox. The Ernie's gritty, girthy tone is optimized using a variety of the finest available new components and sweet-sounding new-old-stock parts. Modern features include small size, DC adapter jack, LED on/off indicator, and true bypass switching. Phattest fuzz of its size! Thick and huge-sounding, this 1973-era-based fuzz is fat on chords and riffs and soars with infinite sustain on single-note runs. Has a wide useable tonal range with a rich midrange bloom. Sounds like a vintage fuzz feeding a cranked up vintage amp, with as much output volume as you could ever want. Video Date &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Maker &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Video &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Time &#x25BC;&#x25B2; 2024-07-08 LEP International ヴィンテージラムズヘッドを再現！Skreddy Pedals Ernie #in30seconds_lep 0:41 2013-03-18 videofile01 Skreddy Ernie 0:59 2011-03-28 simplexiammine Skreddy Ernie 7:33 2011-02-17 theGASstation Skreddy Ernie 2:43 2010-07-24 elswan64 Skreddy Lady vs Ernie 7:52 2010-07-17 elswan64 Skreddy Ernie 3:36 2010-07-17 elswan64 Skreddy Top Fuel-Mayo-Pink Flesh-Ernie-Supa Tone 6:42 2010-04-08 Kayzer Skreddy - Ernie (Comparison 5 of 8) 2:31 2009-09-09 Gearmanndude Skreddy Ernie Fuzz guitar effects pedal demo with SG & Dr Z MAZ 5:44 2009-03-09 tatoi skreddy ernie 4:54 2009-02-05 Crxshdxmmy Gear Demo - Skreddy Ernie (Les Paul) 3:29 2008-11-02 Crxshdxmmy Gear Demo - Skreddy Ernie 3:31 Reviews myFXDB user reviews No reviews yet + Add your review Links Skreddy Pedals Skreddy Pedals Ernie Where to find one? Ads! This site contains affiliate links for which I may be compensated Skreddy Pedals Ernie for sale on eBay: World & Stores Australia Canada France Germany Italy Spain UK US Other sites your browser doesn't support AJAX? fx pedal stompbox stomp box guitar effects pedal fuzz distortion/fuzz/overdrive dirt grit Searching... Twitter (opens in new tab) Facebook (opens in new