unding 4-transistor fuzz I can make (with parts available to me) today. I think you are going to love it. Not super, over-the-top, crazy-high gain, but walks the fine line between aggressive and laid-back. Lay into the notes for that deep, harmonic saturation and violin-like sustain. All your detail and articulation are preserved throughout the sustain knob's travel. Low noise floor, too! Video Date &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Maker &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Video &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Time &#x25BC;&#x25B2; 2011-03-21 JetCityMusic Skreddy Pedals Pig Mine 4:35 2011-01-02 jfusion10 Skreddy Pig Mine Guitar Demo 6:00 2010-12-26 elswan64 Skreddy Pink Flesh VS Skreddy Pig Mine 7:48 2010-11-14 simplexiammine Skreddy Pig Mine 8:44 2010-08-16 Bobby DeVito Bobby DeVito demo SKREDDY Pig Mine FUZZ Pink Flesh Mayo Zero 9:14 2010-04-08 Kayzer Skreddy - Pig Mine (Comparison 7 of 8) 1:48 Reviews myFXDB user reviews No reviews yet + Add your review Links Skreddy Pedals Skreddy Pedals Pig Mine Related Skreddy Pedals Pig Mine Skreddy Pedals P19 Where to find one? Ads! This site contains affiliate links for which I may be compensated Skreddy Pedals Pig Mine for sale on eBay: World & Stores Australia Canada France Germany Italy Spain UK US Other sites your browser doesn't support AJAX? fx pedal stompbox stomp box guitar effects pedal fuzz distortion/fuzz/overdrive dirt grit Searching... Twitter (opens in new tab) Facebook (opens in new tab) YouTube (opens in new tab) Instagram (opens in new tab) Privacy policy - Imprint hosted at Unix-Solutions",
