          "snippet": "Skreddy Pedals Supa Tone - Effects Database",
          "bodyExcerpt": "Skreddy Pedals Supa Tone | Effects Database Skip to navigation Brands &#9660; 0-9... a... b... c... d... e... f... g... h... i... j... k... l... m... n... o... p... q... r... s... t... u... v... w... x... y... z... Effect types &#9660; boost distortion fuzz overdrive acoustic simulation amp simulation speaker/cabinet simulation chorus flanger phaser tremolo vibe vibrato other modulation pitch shifter octaver delay reverb looper/sampler hold/freeze eq filter wah fuzz-wah bitcrusher ring modulator samplerate reducer wavefolder synth effect granular effect multi effect vocal effect talkbox vocoder buffer compressor other... Countries &#9660; (country unknown) Argentina Australia Austria Belarus Belgium Brazil Bulgaria Canada Chile China Colombia Costa Rica Croatia Czech Republic Czechoslovakia DDR Denmark Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt Estonia Finland France Germany Greece Hungary India Indonesia Iran Ireland Israel Italy Japan Latvia Lithuania Luxembourg Macedonia Malaysia Malta Mexico Moldova Monaco Morocco Netherlands New-Zealand Norway Panama Peru Philippines Poland Portugal Romania Russia Serbia Singapore Slovakia Slovenia South-Africa South-Korea Spain Sweden Switzerland Taiwan Thailand Turkey U.K. U.S.A. U.S.S.R. Ukraine Uruguay Venezuela Browse by &#9660; Enclosure type Modulation type Special &#9658; Classics Eye candy Funny Vaporware Weird Random brand Random effect Events &#9658; NAMM Musikmesse Music China Guitar Summit More... &#9660; Forum (opens in new tab) myFXDB (opens in new tab) Newsletter About How to get listed? Interviews Reviews Effects explained Books D.I.Y. Schematics Links Contact Install Effects Database App Search the database browse by brand S... Skreddy Pedals browse by type distortion/fuzz/overdrive fuzz browse by enclosure pedal Skreddy Pedals Supa Tone Published on June 12, 2010 Skreddy Pedals fuzz pedal Information Skreddy Pedals Skreddy Pedals™ Supa Tone: based on a 1974 edition of a fuzz released by Colorsound™, this circuit is not based on a germanium Tone Bender design but is a variant of the Big Muff™ circuit. The first pair clipping diodes is removed, so there is more clean boost in front of the remaining pair of clipping diodes. Like the originals, I've used all polyester film coupling capacitors to retain every bit of high end rasp. I've used low-gain transistors (also like the originals) to retain dynamics and avoid going into syrupy-sustain territory. The tone stack is the original mid scoop, with my customary flat-mids switch added in case you have need of it. Video Date &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Maker &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Video &#x25BC;&#x25B2; Time &#x25BC;&#x25B2; 2012-08-21 JokeAndRazz Guitar fuzz SKREDDY SUPA TONE 1:14 2012-07-27 JokeAndRazz Guitar fuzz SKREDDY SUPA TONE 2:20 2012-02-12 MrExcane Skreddy Supa Tone - Echo Delay - BASS with FULL MIX 3:45 2012-02-09 JetCityMusic Skreddy Pedals Supa Tone 2 5:56 2012-01-20 Bukowski Skreddy Supa Tone 2:07 2012-01-15 MrExcane Skreddy Echo Delay - Supa Tone Fuzz - BASS Demo 8:49 2012-01-12 bassfuzzcom BassFuzz.Com Presents: Skreddy Supa Tone (Take 2) 6:06 2012-01-05 bassfuzzcom Bassfuzz.com Presents: Skreddy Supa Tone 5:38 2011-12-19 MrExcane Skreddy Supa Tone Fuzz - Subdecay Echobox Delay - Guitar Demo 6:43 2011-11-23 MrExcane Skreddy Pedals Supa Tone Fuzz - BASS DEMO 8:28 2011-11-14 drowninginguitars Skreddy Supa Tone Fuzz Demo 2:13 2011-03-16 JetCityMusic Skreddy Supa Tone 3:56 2010-09-09 gaedp86 A Skreddy Supa Tone Clip! 3:21 2010-09-05 simplexiammine Skreddy Supa Tone 8:24 2010-09-04 Kayzer Skreddy - Supa Tone 4:45 2010-09-04 Kayzer Skreddy - Supa Tone VS Skreddy - Pink Flesh 3:10 2010-07-17 elswan64 Skreddy Supa Tone 4:21 2010-07-17 elswan64 Skreddy Top Fuel-Mayo-Pink Flesh-Ernie-Supa Tone 6:42 Reviews myFXDB user reviews No reviews yet + Add your review Links Skreddy Pedals Skreddy Pedals Supa Tone Related Gary Hurst Tone Bender MkI (wood original) Gary Hurst Tone Bender MkI (wood reissue) Abraxas Sound MkI Fuzz Abrax